flowchart TB
  req[Incoming request]
  req --> svc{X-Arti-Service-Secret matches?}
  svc -- yes --> ok[Admit as service identity]
  svc -- no --> hdr{X-Auth-Request-Email present? ProtectedIngress}

  hdr -- yes --> gates1{Domain allowlist and required groups}
  gates1 -- pass --> ok
  gates1 -- fail --> forbid[403 forbidden]

  hdr -- no --> tok{Bearer / cookie token present?}
  tok -- no --> unauth[401 unauthorized]
  tok -- yes --> oidc{OIDC verify -- Dex JWKS}
  oidc -- valid --> gates2{Domain and groups}
  gates2 -- pass --> ok
  gates2 -- fail --> forbid
  oidc -- not OIDC --> hs{HS256 verify -- session or CLI token}
  hs -- invalid --> unauth
  hs -- app-scoped or embed-scoped --> reject[Reject on session routes]
  hs -- valid user / upload --> ok

  ok --> guard{Upload-scoped token?}
  guard -- yes --> allow[EnforceUploadScope -- create/append/read only, family check, body cap]
  guard -- no --> handler[Handler]
  allow --> handler
